flowchart LR
  subgraph WHO[Who acts]
    direction TB
    AG[Agent<br/>MCP client]
    ME[You<br/>the author]
  end
  subgraph TOOLS[Bragi, on your machine]
    direction TB
    MCP[MCP server<br/>5 read tools<br/>and propose_decision]
    CLI[bragi CLI<br/>read only]
    ED[Local editor<br/>127.0.0.1 only]
  end
  subgraph FILES[Your folders, plain files]
    direction TB
    DR[Drafts<br/>one folder per article]
    LE[Ledger<br/>one file per decision]
    PP[Proposals<br/>one file per candidate]
  end
  AG --> MCP
  ME --> ED
  ME --> CLI
  MCP -.->|reads| DR
  MCP -.->|reads| LE
  CLI -.->|reads| LE
  MCP ==>|writes a candidate| PP
  ED -.->|shows| PP
  ED ==>|adopt: one new file<br/>retire: two lines| LE
  classDef hot stroke:#c8401e,stroke-width:2px
  class ED,LE hot
